## Native code

```elisp
(defun greet (name)
  "Return a friendly greeting."
  (format "Hello, %s!" name))
```

```python
def greet(name):
    # Native language tokens, not a single code color.
    return f"Hello, {name}!"
```

> Quoted prose follows the body font.
>
> Another paragraph in the quote.

